Adapted parts (rewritten, not copied verbatim): the overall menu layout, the system
information collection (CPU usage sampling from /proc/stat, uptime formatting), the
multi-distro update/clean flows, the BBR sysctl approach, the list of third-party
test scripts in the "测试脚本合集" menu, the step list of the one-click system tuning
("一条龙系统调优"), and the app market entries (official install commands of 1Panel,
BT Panel and aaPanel, and the docker run parameters for OpenList).

The following projects by NX2406 are integrated:
  - vps-PSL  (https://github.com/NX2406/vps-PSL)  invoked as-is for port speed limiting
  - ovhroot  (https://github.com/NX2406/ovhroot)  root-login logic re-implemented in nx.sh,
             the original script is also available from the menu

Third-party scripts in the test menu, NextTrace, LinuxMirrors, bin456789/reinstall,
ylx2016/Linux-NetSpeed, get.docker.com and Incus are downloaded and run from their
upstream sources at the user's request; they are not distributed with this project.
